  "goodToKnow": "Kapitalistisch means capitalist: das kapitalistische System, kapitalistische Länder. Der Kapitalismus is capitalism and der Kapitalist a capitalist. Karl Marx, from Trier, wrote Das Kapital (1867) in German. West Germany called its model soziale Marktwirtschaft rather than Kapitalismus, and in the GDR, kapitalistisch was a standard insult for the West."
